	(text "Copied from the Radxa Rock 5B v1.45 schematic, sheets 4 and 12. Net names follow the reference, minus 'LP4/4X_'.\ntools/verify_ddr.py confirms every memory-chip signal ball and its net against the reference page.\nLPDDR4X only: VDDQ is tied to the 0.6 V rail, and VDD1 is taken straight from VCC_1V8_S3 (the reference\nhas zero-ohm option links there). The LPDDR5-only pins (WCK, A6) are left unconnected, as in the reference.\nThis interface must be laid out by copying Rockchip's memory layout template, not routed freehand."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
